*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Dell MFP Laser 3115cn, PCL XL rendered on the host by Ghostscript (filter dell3115cn-pxl).
*% Replaces Dell's PostScript PPD: the printer's PostScript interpreter is slow and prints
*% washed-out colours for rasterised pages. See docs/PRINTER.md, "PCL XL".
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "DL3115PX.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Dell"
*Product: "(MFP Laser 3115cn)"
*ModelName: "Dell MFP Laser 3115cn"
*ShortNickName: "Dell MFP Laser 3115cn PCL XL"
*NickName: "Dell MFP Laser 3115cn PCL XL (Ghostscript)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Dell;CMD:PJL,PCLXL,POSTSCRIPT;MDL:MFP Laser 3115cn;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "16"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsEvenDuplex: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 dell3115cn-pxl"

